cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this educational implementation, please cite this repository and the original LLaDA paper."
title: "Educational LLaDA-style Diffusion Language Model"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Hong"
    given-names: "Simon"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-03"
license: "MIT"
abstract: >-
  A compact TensorFlow/Keras educational implementation of a masked
  discrete-diffusion language model inspired by LLaDA, with explicit forward
  masking, masked-token training, iterative denoising, confidence-based
  remasking, optional classifier-free guidance, EMA evaluation, and
  pedagogical quick/full training presets.
keywords:
  - diffusion language model
  - LLaDA
  - masked diffusion
  - TensorFlow
  - Keras
  - language modeling
  - education
